From: TekRantGaming <craigferels896@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 17:15:31 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 15/16] UI: fullscreen display modes (exclusive fullscreen at a
 chosen resolution)

rex::ui::GetFullscreenDisplayModes lists a display's modes and
rex::ui::SetFullscreenDisplayMode sets the mode SDL uses whenever the window
is fullscreen (none: borderless at the desktop's resolution, the default).
A host linking SDL itself cannot do this: its SDL copy sees neither the
SDK's window nor the displays.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 include/rex/ui/display_mode.h | 44 ++++++++++++++++
 include/rex/ui/window_sdl.h   |  1 +
 src/ui/window_sdl.cpp         | 97 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 142 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 include/rex/ui/display_mode.h

